.
.  Create a GIF file for a run sequence plot
.
DEVICE 1 OFF
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
.
LET Y = NORMAL RANDOM NUMBERS FOR I = 1 1 1000
.
TITLE AUTOMATIC
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Ordered Data (1,000 Normal Random Numbers)
X1LABEL Normal N(0,1) Order Statistics Medians
LABEL SIZE 3
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
.
PRE-ERASE OFF
NORMAL PROBABILITY PLOT Y
.
QUIT
